(These remarks apply with tenfold force to the use of intoxicating) Tj T*
(drinks. To make money, requires a clear brain. A man has got to see that) Tj T*
(two and two make four; he must lay all his plans with reflection and) Tj T*
(forethought, and closely examine all the details and the ins and outs) Tj T*
(of business. As no man can succeed in business unless he has a brain to) Tj T*
(enable him to lay his plans, and reason to guide him in their execution,) Tj T*
(so, no matter how bountifully a man may be blessed with intelligence, if) Tj T*
(the brain is muddled, and his judgment warped by intoxicating drinks, it) Tj T*
(is impossible for him to carry on business successfully. How many good) Tj T*
(opportunities have passed, never to return, while a man was sipping a) Tj T*
("social glass," with his friend! How many foolish bargains have been) Tj T*
(made under the influence of the "nervine," which temporarily makes its) Tj T*
(victim think he is rich. How many important chances have been put off) Tj T*
(until to-morrow, and then forever, because the wine cup has thrown the) Tj T*
(system into a state of lassitude, neutralizing the energies so) Tj T*
(essential to success in business. Verily, "wine is a mocker." The use of) Tj T*
